value.lower()\n    value = re.sub(r\"[^a-z0-9]+\", \"-\", value)\n    return value.strip(\"-\")\n```\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Unicode is NFKD-normalized and stripped to ASCII (e.g. `Café déjà vu` → `cafe-deja-vu`)\n- Lowercased\n- Any run of punctuation/whitespace collapses to a single hyphen, and leading/trailing hyphens are trimmed\n- Empty/whitespace-only input returns `\"\"`, not `\"-\"`\n\n**Verification:** Since the repo ships no test suite, I ran an inline sanity check covering punctuation, repeated whitespace, mixed case, accented characters, digits, empty input, and leading/trailing hyphens — all passed.", "usage": {"input_tokens": 9156, "cached_tokens": 4096, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 298, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "estimated": false, "total_tokens": 9454}}}
{"event_id": "e9f21779", "event_type": "task_complete", "task_id": "b2-pruning_only-huge-tool-history", "timestamp": "2026-09-16T07:25:31.609684+00:00", "payload": {"steps": 7, "summary": "Done. The task was to implement `slugify()` in `slug.py`.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe repository contained only `slug.py` with a stub raising `NotImplementedError` (the large tool history in the prompt was unrelated historical benchmark output; no actual tests existed in the repo).\n\n**Change made** — implemented `slugify` to produce lowercase URL slugs:\n\n```python\nimport re\nimport unicodedata\n\n\ndef slugify(value):\n    value = unicodedata.normalize(\"NFKD\", str(value))\n    value = value.encode(\"ascii\", \"ignore\").decode(\"ascii\")\n    value = value.lower()\n    value = re.sub(r\"[^a-z0-9]+\", \"-\", value)\n    return value.strip(\"-\")\n```\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Unicode is NFKD-normalized and stripped to ASCII (e.g. `Café déjà vu` → `cafe-deja-vu`)\n- Lowercased\n- Any run of punctuation/whitespace collapses to a single hyphen, and leading/trailing hyphens are trimmed\n- Empty/whitespace-only input returns `\"\"`, not `\"-\"`\n\n**Verification:** Since the repo ships no test suite, I ran an inline sanity check covering punctuation, repeated whitespace, mixed case, accented characters, digits, empty input, and leading/trailing hyphens — all passed."}}
